+const navItems=[['Home','home'],['Berserk','berserk'],['Projects','projects'],['Channels','channels'],['Editor','editor'],['Styles','styles'],['Library','library'],['Memory','memory'],['Routines','routines'],['Renders','renders'],['YouTube','youtube']];
+let screen='home',project=null,projects=[],jobId=null,passJobId=null,mode='quality',jobTimer=null,passTimer=null,annotations=[];
+async function api(path,body){const r=await fetch(path,body?{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify(body)}:{});let d;try{d=await r.json()}catch(_){d={error:await r.text()}}if(!r.ok)throw Error(d.error||`Request failed (${r.status})`);return d}
+function toast(s){const t=$('#toast');t.textContent=s;t.classList.add('show');clearTimeout(toast.t);toast.t=setTimeout(()=>t.classList.remove('show'),3600)}
+function heading(title,sub=''){return `<h1>${esc(title)}</h1>${sub?`<p class="sub">${esc(sub)}</p>`:''}`}
+function panel(title,content,extra=''){return `<section class="card ${extra}"><h3>${title}</h3>${content}</section>`}
+function badge(text,cls=''){return `<span class="badge ${cls}">${esc(text)}</span>`}
+function setNav(){const nav=$('#nav');nav.innerHTML=`<div class="nav-label">Workspace</div>`+navItems.map(([n,id],i)=>`${i===4?'<div class="nav-label">Production</div>':''}<button data-screen="${id}" class="${screen===id?'active':''}">${n}</button>`).join('');$('#screenTitle').textContent=navItems.find(x=>x[1]===screen)?.[0]||'New project';$('#railProject').textContent=project?.title||project?.name||'No project';$('#topProject').textContent=project?`${project.title||project.name} · ${project.path||''}`:''}
+async function refreshProject(){try{project=await api('/api/project')}catch(e){toast(e.message)}}
+async function boot(){setNav();try{projects=await api('/api/projects');await refreshProject();await refreshSeats();render()}catch(e){$('#view').innerHTML=`${heading('Heart Studio','The local server could not provide project data.')}<div class="warning">${esc(e.message)}</div>`}}
+async function refreshSeats(){try{const d=await api('/api/connections');const rows=d.connections||[];$('#seats').innerHTML=['GPT','Gemini','Opus','GLM'].map(n=>{const x=rows.find(c=>c.name===n)||{};return `<div class="seat"><i class="${x.status==='connected'?'connected':''}"></i>${n} <span class="muted">${esc(x.status||'unprobed')}</span></div>`}).join('')}catch(_){}}
+function render(){setNav();const view=$('#view');const pages={home:homePage,berserk:berserkPage,projects:projectsPage,new:newPage,editor:editorPage,renders:rendersPage};if(pages[screen])view.innerHTML=pages[screen]();else view.innerHTML=`${heading(navItems.find(x=>x[1]===screen)?.[0]||screen)}<div class="card"><div class="row">${badge('not wired yet','not-wired')}</div><p class="muted">There is no backend for this section yet.</p></div>`;bindPage();}
+function invBadges(p){return `<div class="stats">${badge(p.script?'Script ready':'No script',p.script?'ok':'')}${badge(p.voice?'Voice ready':'No voice',p.voice?'ok':'')}${badge(p.timing?'Timing ready':'No timing',p.timing?'ok':'')}${badge(`${p.boardCount||0} board frames`)}${badge(p.master?'Master ready':'No master',p.master?'ok':'')}</div>`}
+function homePage(){const cards=projects.map(p=>`<article class="card"><div class="row between"><h3>${esc(p.title||p.name)}</h3>${badge(p.name===project?.name?'Selected':'Project')}</div>${invBadges(p)}<div class="row" style="margin-top:12px"><button data-select="${esc(p.name)}">Select</button><button data-open-editor="${esc(p.name)}">Open Editor</button></div></article>`).join('');return `${heading('Home','The production floor for projects, seats, and dispatched work.')}<div class="section-head"><h2>Model seats</h2><button id="probeHome">Probe all seats</button></div><div class="grid two">${['GPT','Gemini','Opus','GLM'].map(n=>panel(n,`<p id="homeSeat-${n}" class="muted">Loading connection state…</p>`)).join('')}</div><div class="section-head"><h2>Projects</h2><button data-screen="projects">All projects →</button></div><div class="grid">${cards||'<div class="empty">No projects found.</div>'}</div><div class="section-head"><h2>Recent fleet runs</h2><button data-screen="renders">View renders →</button></div><div id="homeRuns" class="card muted">Loading fleet runs…</div>`}
+function legNames(){return ['script','voice','timing','board','sound','gates','export']}
+function berserkPage(){const legs=legNames().map(x=>`<div class="leg"><b>${x}</b><span id="leg-${x}" class="chip">waiting</span></div>`).join('');return `${heading('Berserk','Supervise the run from brief checks through verified export.')}<section class="hero-console"><div class="row between"><div><span class="eyebrow">RUN CONTROL · ACTIVE PROJECT</span><h2 style="margin-top:5px">${esc(project?.title||project?.name||'No project selected')}</h2></div><span id="runStatus" class="chip">idle</span></div><div class="run-controls"><div class="field"><label>Build mode</label><div class="segmented"><button data-mode="quality" class="${mode==='quality'?'selected':''}">Quality</button><button data-mode="faster" class="${mode==='faster'?'selected':''}">Faster</button></div></div><div class="field"><label for="runModel">Model</label><select id="runModel"><option value="free/glm-5.3-flashx">GLM 5.3 FlashX</option><option value="free/gpt-6-luna">GPT 6 Luna</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="runEffort">Effort</label><select id="runEffort"><option>standard</option><option>high</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="runSpec">Render spec</label><input id="runSpec" value="render:0:30"></div><label class="field"><span>Stills</span><span><input id="dispatchStills" type="checkbox"> Dispatch for board</span></label><button id="runBtn" class="btn-primary">▶ RUN</button></div></section><div class="waiting" id="waitingLine">Waiting on you: nothing</div><div class="section-head"><h2>Run legs</h2><span class="muted">Artifact predicates control completion</span></div><div class="legs">${legs}</div><div class="section-head"><h2>Live supervision feed</h2><button id="stopBtn" class="btn-danger" disabled>■ Stop</button></div><div class="feed" id="runFeed">Run events will appear here when a job starts.</div><div class="section-head"><h2>Board frames <span class="muted">· click a frame to annotate</span></h2></div><div class="frames">${(project?.board||[]).map(f=>`<button class="frame" data-frame="${esc(f)}"><img src="/project/out/board/${encodeURIComponent(f)}"><span>${esc(f)}</span></button>`).join('')||'<div class="empty">No board stills found for this project.</div>'}</div><div class="section-head"><h2>Frame annotations</h2></div><div id="annotations" class="annotation-list"></div><div class="section-head"><h2>Steer the run</h2></div><div class="inline-form"><input id="steerText" placeholder="Tell the program what to change while it works" ${jobId?'':'disabled'}><button id="steerBtn" ${jobId?'':'disabled'}>Send</button></div>${jobId?'':'<small class="muted">Steering is live during a run</small>'}<div class="section-head"><h2>Dispatch</h2></div><div class="grid two"><section class="card"><h3>Storyboard stills</h3><p class="muted">Uses this project’s effective settings.</p><div class="inline-form"><input id="stillsSpec" value="render:0:30"><button id="stillsBtn">Dispatch stills</button></div><p id="stillsStatus" class="muted"></p></section><section class="card"><h3>Assembly</h3><div class="field"><label>Frames run id</label><input id="framesRun" placeholder="GitHub Actions run id"></div><div class="row"><label>FPS <select id="assemblyFps"><option>24</option><option selected>30</option></select></label><label>Mix path <input id="mixPath" value="audio/final_mix.wav"></label><button id="assemblyBtn">Dispatch assembly</button></div><p id="assemblyStatus" class="muted"></p></section></div><div class="section-head"><h2>Film render queue</h2>${badge('not dispatchable from inside the program yet','not-wired')}</div><div id="colab" class="card muted">Loading queue…</div>`}
+function projectsPage(){return `${heading('Projects','Choose the project controlled by the production console.')}<div class="grid">${projects.map(p=>`<article class="card"><h3>${esc(p.title||p.name)}</h3><p class="muted">${esc(p.name)}</p>${invBadges(p)}<div class="row" style="margin-top:14px"><button data-select="${esc(p.name)}">Select</button><button data-open-editor="${esc(p.name)}">Open in Editor</button></div></article>`).join('')}</div>`}
+function newPage(){return `${heading('New project','Start with a brief and attach the original narration file.')}<div class="grid two"><form class="card" id="newForm"><h3>Project brief</h3><div class="field"><label>Name</label><input name="name" pattern="[a-zA-Z0-9_-]+" required placeholder="my-short-film"></div><div class="field"><label>Idea / direction</label><textarea name="idea" required placeholder="Describe the film and what the program should build."></textarea></div><div class="field"><label>Voice file (used exactly as provided)</label><div class="inline-form"><input name="audioPath" required placeholder="Absolute audio file path"><button type="button" data-pick="audio" data-target="audioPath">Pick</button></div></div><div class="field"><label>Timings file (optional)</label><div class="inline-form"><input name="timingsPath" placeholder="Optional absolute path"><button type="button" data-pick="text" data-target="timingsPath">Pick</button></div></div><div class="field"><label>Template</label><select name="template">${projects.map(p=>`<option value="${esc(p.name)}" ${p.name==='demo-ring'?'selected':''}>${esc(p.name)}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><button class="btn-primary">Create project</button></form><section class="card"><h3>Creation result</h3><div id="newResult" class="muted">The created project and push result will appear here.</div></section></div>`}
+function editorPage(){return `${heading('Editor',`Project anatomy and measured evidence · ${project?.title||project?.name||''}`)}<div class="section-head"><h2>Stations</h2><button id="refreshEditor">Refresh evidence</button></div><div class="grid">${[['Script & voice',project?.script,project?.voice],['Timing',project?.timing],['Board',project?.boardCount?`${project.boardCount} frames`:null],['QC gates',project?.gates?.pass?'All measured checks pass':'Checks need attention'],['Render',project?.runInfo?.filmGradedInFrames?'Frame grade recorded':null],['Finish',project?.runInfo?.filmGrade||null],['Master',project?.master]].map(([t,...e])=>panel(t,`<p>${e.filter(Boolean).map(esc).join('<br>')||'<span class="muted">No matching artifact on disk.</span>'}</p>`)).join('')}</div><div class="section-head"><h2>Programmatic QC gates</h2></div><div class="card" id="qc"></div><div class="section-head"><h2>Project settings</h2></div><form class="card" id="settingsForm"><div class="row"><label><input type="checkbox" name="captions" ${project?.settings?.captions?.on?'checked':''}> Captions</label><label>Frame rate <select name="fps"><option value="24" ${project?.settings?.fps===24?'selected':''}>24 fps</option><option value="30" ${project?.settings?.fps!==24?'selected':''}>30 fps</option></select></label><button>Save settings</button><span id="settingsNote" class="muted"></span></div></form><div class="section-head"><h2>History</h2></div><div id="history" class="card muted">Loading project history…</div><div class="section-head"><h2>Board stills</h2></div><div class="frames">${(project?.board||[]).map(f=>`<button class="frame" data-frame="${esc(f)}"><img src="/project/out/board/${encodeURIComponent(f)}"><span>${esc(f)}</span></button>`).join('')||'<div class="empty">No board stills found.</div>'}</div><div class="section-head"><h2>Slice narration</h2></div><div class="card"><div class="inline-form"><input id="sliceSeconds" type="number" min="0.1" max="600" value="30"><button id="sliceBtn">Create slice</button></div><div id="sliceResult" class="muted"></div></div><div class="section-head"><h2>Sound mix</h2></div><div class="card"><button id="mixBtn">Mix now</button><span id="mixResult" class="muted"></span></div><div class="section-head"><h2>Pass checkpoints</h2><span class="muted">Build → Camera angles → Environment overhaul → Post-processing → Shading</span></div><div id="passes" class="pass-list"></div><div class="section-head"><h2>Pass feed</h2></div><div id="passFeed" class="feed">Select Run on an available pass to see its feed.</div><div class="section-head"><h2>Frame annotations</h2></div><div id="annotations" class="annotation-list"></div>`}
+function rendersPage(){return `${heading('Renders','GitHub Actions fleet runs reported by the dispatch layer.')}<div class="card" id="renderTable">Loading fleet runs…</div>`}
